<title>THAILAND: Thai 1997 exports seen up 7.2 pct,imports 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Thai 1997 exports seen up 7.2 pct,imports 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand revised the projection for exports growth this year down to 7.2 percent from 7.7 percent projected earlier.</p>
<p>Imports were also forecast to rise by 2.4 percent year on year, a sharp drop from 8.0 percent projected earlier.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
